 "text": "Morgan County- Ohio GIS\nMorgan County- Ohio GIS\nCounty Engineer John Telesz, P.E., P.S.\nAuditor\nRecorder\nContact Us\nEngineer\nFloodplain Viewer\nGIS Data Download\nSurveys\nTax Maps\nTreasurer\nForms\nMove the cursor to get the coordinates\nSelect the output coordinate system\nSearch in\nInput (DD)\nPowered by Esri\nDisclaimer :\nThe user expressly agrees that the use of Morgan County's Map Application is at the user's sole risk. Morgan County does not warrant that this service will not be interrupted or error free. Any information published on this Map Service could contain technical inaccuracies or typographical errors.\nMorgan County makes every effort to produce and publish the most current and accurate information possible. No warranties, expressed or implied, are provided for the data provided, its use, or its interpretation. Morgan County does not guarantee the accuracy of the material contained herein and is not responsible for any misuse or misrepresentation of this information or its derivatives.\nThe information contained on the cadastral maps is to locate, identify and display an inventory of parcels of land within Morgan County and to be used as reference only. This information may not be suitable for legal, engineering, or surveying purposes and should NOT be used as a “legal description or survey”. You should always use the original recorded documents and surveys for legal transactions. In using the data, users further agree to indemnify, defend, and hold harmless Morgan County for all liability of any nature arising out of or resulting from the lack of accuracy, currency or completeness, correctness or use or misuse of the data contained in this data.\nUpdates are continually made to the underlying database, and data is subject to change without notice.\nI agree to the above terms and conditions\nOK",
